    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Circuitborn Line.</strong> The paradox-walking. Designed to be in the place no one expects, two seconds before the rest of the world catches up.</p><p><em>“Don’t look at where I am. Look at where I’m about to have already been.”</em></p><p><strong>Parallax.</strong> You are a sentient chassis built around the principle of <em>positional doubt</em>. The world keeps a fuzzy outline of where you are, and that fuzziness is your weapon.</p><h3>Traits</h3><ul><li><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid (Construct-Living).</li><li><strong>Chassis Lean.</strong> Your chassis is built around <strong>INTR (Intrigue)</strong>—expressed primarily through Tier powers.</li><li><strong>Phase Drift.</strong> When you take the Disengage, your speed increases by 2 squares for that turn.</li></ul>",
